  "campaignM1Title": "The door that sticks",
  "campaignM1Story": "Night falls. The old gate of the lantern tower is stuck. In a role-playing game, when the outcome is uncertain, you roll the dice.",
  "campaignM1Lesson": "A check: roll a die and compare the result to a target.",
  "campaignM1Task": "Throw the dice below. A 4 or more opens the gate. Otherwise, try again.",
  "campaignM1Badge": "Gate opener",
  "campaignM2Title": "A fragile lantern",
  "campaignM2Story": "Inside, the lantern shakes and every shock cracks its glass. Your hero has life points too, and the game keeps track of them.",
  "campaignM2Lesson": "Life points go down when you are hurt and up when you heal.",
  "campaignM2Task": "Use the hearts below: lose two for the shocks, then win one back by resting.",
  "campaignM2Badge": "Keeper of hearts",
  "campaignM3Title": "Who are you?",
  "campaignM3Story": "A voice asks your name. Every hero has a name, strengths and a few powers, all written on a character sheet.",
  "campaignM3Lesson": "A character sheet gathers everything that makes your hero unique.",
  "campaignM3Task": "Add a hero with a name, then give it a power.",
  "campaignM3Badge": "Hero with a name",
  "campaignM4Title": "The shadow in the hall",
  "campaignM4Story": "A shadow blocks the stairs. A fight is just a series of rolls, each hit costing the enemy a little life.",
  "campaignM4Lesson": "In a fight, you take turns rolling and lowering life points.",
  "campaignM4Task": "Throw the dice: a total of 7 or more hurts the shadow. Land three hits.",
  "campaignM4Badge": "Shadow chaser",
  "campaignM5Title": "Two stairways",
  "campaignM5Story": "The stairs split in two: one climbs into the cold, the other dives into the cellar. Nobody tells you which is right. Tonight, you decide.",
  "campaignM5Lesson": "In a role-playing game, your choices change the story.",
  "campaignM5Task": "Draw a dilemma for inspiration, then choose your way.",
  "campaignM5Badge": "Path chooser",
  "campaignM5ChoiceA": "Climb the cold stairs",
  "campaignM5ChoiceB": "Go down to the cellar",
  "campaignM5OutcomeA": "The cold sharpens your senses and you reach the top without a sound.",
  "campaignM5OutcomeB": "In the dark, your hands find a forgotten key.",
  "campaignM6Title": "The lantern relights",
  "campaignM6Story": "At the top, the lantern waits. Describe out loud how you relight it before the sand runs out: telling the scene is the heart of the game.",
  "campaignM6Lesson": "A scene is told together, out loud, with a bit of imagination.",
  "campaignM6Task": "Start the hourglass and narrate your final scene.",
  "campaignM6Badge": "Flame bearer",
